    "This feeling is temporary and will pass.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieses Gefühl ist vorübergehend und wird vergehen."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce sentiment est passager et s'en ira."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この感覚は一時的で、必ず過ぎ去ります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What are three things you're grateful for right now?": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wofür bist du gerade dankbar? Nenne drei Dinge."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quelles sont trois choses pour lesquelles vous êtes reconnaissant·e en ce moment ?"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "今、感謝していること3つは何ですか？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What boundary would help your peace of mind?": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Welche Grenze würde deinem Seelenfrieden helfen?"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quelle limite aiderait votre tranquillité d’esprit ?"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "心の平穏のために、どんな境界線が役立ちますか？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What coping skill helped you most this week?": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Welche Bewältigungstechnik hat dir diese Woche am meisten geholfen?"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quelle technique d’adaptation vous a le plus aidé cette semaine ?"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "今週、最も役立った対処法は何ですか？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What made you feel safe today?": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Was hat dir heute Sicherheit gegeben?"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qu’est-ce qui vous a fait sentir en sécurité aujourd’hui ?"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "今日、安心できたのはどんなことですか？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What small win can you celebrate today?": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Welchen kleinen Erfolg kannst du heute feiern?"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quelle petite victoire pouvez-vous célébrer aujourd’hui ?"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "今日、祝える小さな勝利は何ですか？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What would you tell a friend feeling anxious?": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Was würdest du einer ängstlichen Freundin oder einem Freund sagen?"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Que diriez-vous à un ami qui se sent anxieux ?"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不安な友人に、あなたなら何と声をかけますか？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Write a letter of compassion to yourself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Schreibe dir selbst einen mitfühlenden Brief."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Écrivez-vous une lettre de bienveillance."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自分自身へ、思いやりの手紙を書きましょう。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Write about a fear that turned out okay.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Schreibe über eine Angst, die sich als unbegründet erwies."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Écrivez à propos d’une peur qui s’est bien terminée."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "結果的に大丈夫だった恐れについて書きましょう。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You did it": {
      "localizations": {
